WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:04.771
Two clouds of neurons, a stack of model layers, and yellow lines between them.

00:00:05.151 --> 00:00:09.903
BioLLM-8B launched with this picture, and a thread about living human neurons

00:00:09.903 --> 00:00:11.883
written into a language model.

00:00:14.165 --> 00:00:15.126
Hi, I'm Dendra.

00:00:15.126 --> 00:00:17.048
The company publishes a results file.

00:00:17.048 --> 00:00:18.970
Let's read that before the thread.

00:00:21.142 --> 00:00:26.530
A patent-pending adapter that writes living human neuron activity into LLM layers.

00:00:28.408 --> 00:00:30.524
The free chat is Qwen3-8B, frozen.

00:00:30.524 --> 00:00:33.698
The site says so, and its layer counts match.

00:00:34.078 --> 00:00:36.515
And the chat does not touch live neurons.

00:00:36.515 --> 00:00:40.779
It replays rows recorded from two cultures, on the ninth and tenth of November.

00:00:42.658 --> 00:00:44.070
The biology is real.

00:00:44.070 --> 00:00:48.308
Neurons grown on an electrode array can be stimulated and recorded, as

00:00:48.308 --> 00:00:49.720
DishBrain showed with Pong.

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:54.677
But DishBrain's claim rests on its controls: silent feedback, no feedback, rest.

00:00:56.492 --> 00:00:57.943
Here is the write.

00:00:57.943 --> 00:01:02.657
A few hundred electrode values from one recorded row, never the stimulated electrodes.

00:01:03.077 --> 00:01:07.239
Fixed ties carry them to every MLP neuron, in all thirty-six layers.

00:01:07.659 --> 00:01:12.274
Each neuron's activation is scaled before down projection, and the next word shifts.

00:01:12.693 --> 00:01:15.630
Now swap in a shuffled row, or random ties.

00:01:15.630 --> 00:01:16.936
The words still move.

00:01:16.936 --> 00:01:18.894
Only the frozen model stays put.

00:01:20.383 --> 00:01:21.873
So test against controls.

00:01:21.873 --> 00:01:26.343
A symbol-trained write on the same rows recovers which of six cues

00:01:26.343 --> 00:01:28.951
the dish received: zero point four three.

00:01:28.951 --> 00:01:31.931
Shuffled, random and energy-only arms sit near chance.

00:01:33.558 --> 00:01:37.205
But on the newest session, the array mean alone separates the symbols.

00:01:37.205 --> 00:01:40.244
So the file will only say the device signal does.

00:01:40.644 --> 00:01:43.594
An earlier letter-by-letter run failed its primary test.

00:01:43.994 --> 00:01:45.767
Its adapter scored the same as sham.

00:01:46.594 --> 00:01:50.570
And for the served adapter, the reply's wording tracks the culture on

00:01:50.570 --> 00:01:52.226
one dish, not the other.

00:01:52.226 --> 00:01:53.551
Both pre-stated rules failed.

00:01:55.483 --> 00:01:58.375
The thread's connectome mapping is display geometry.

00:01:58.795 --> 00:02:01.904
The quantum microtubules are a labelled model, out of scope.

00:02:02.324 --> 00:02:04.197
And the Jacobian lens only reads.

00:02:06.142 --> 00:02:08.128
A careful harness under a loud thread.

00:02:08.128 --> 00:02:09.263
The cue gets through.

00:02:09.263 --> 00:02:11.817
That the neurons carry it is not yet shown.

00:02:14.775 --> 00:02:15.496
To recap.

00:02:15.496 --> 00:02:19.460
A frozen model, replayed recordings, a readout that beats its controls,

00:02:19.460 --> 00:02:20.902
and an open question.

00:02:20.902 --> 00:02:21.983
Thanks for watching!

00:02:22.403 --> 00:02:24.486
Every source is in the full article.

00:02:24.486 --> 00:02:25.081
I'm Dendra.

00:02:25.081 --> 00:02:25.379
Bye!
